WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.360
Hi, everyone.  We meet again.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:09.650
Welcome to Nico Smiley's recap room!

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:17.430
Yuya is dueling in his third match to 
qualify for the Junior Youth Championship.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:23.570
His opponent is Mieru Houchun, who can see 
the future with her fortunetelling dueling.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.740
With her Flip Monsters,

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:31.010
her fortunetelling dueling is draining 
Yuya's life points and emotions.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.160
He Pendulum Summoned to make a comeback,

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:43.080
but he can't do anything because all his 
monsters were switched to defense position.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.520
And then there was this prophecy!

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.500
Tarotrei will now read your future.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:08.550
Tarotrei reveals The Tower right-side up.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:13.370
This card symbolizes destruction, 
falling and tragedy.

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.080
You must give up.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.600
If you continue, you may lose your life!

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:36.170
How will that scary prophecy 
affect Yuya's destiny?

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:40.080
And there is another who faces 
a new challenge of destiny.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:46.620
I won't go easy on you.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:47.320
Right!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:57.320
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:02.090
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:05.410
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:09.410
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:28.190
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.600
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.340
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:44.910
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.110
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:52.320
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:03.060
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:10.000
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.940
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:17.340
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:27.620
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.960
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:41.000
The Mysterious Eye

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.600
Lose his life?

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:55.770
Whatever!  She's talking nonsense 
to take him off his game!

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:59.980
But isn't Yuya getting shivers 
because he's in a terrible pinch?

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:04.860
All the monsters he Pendulum 
Summoned are in defense position.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:10.060
And due to Petalelf's effect, they 
can't change battle position this turn.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:14.080
And since he summoned many 
monsters, his hand is empty.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.300
It's a hopeless situation!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.040
There's nothing I can do right now.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.600
But I still have my monsters.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:25.510
As long as I have them, I can still fight!

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.000
It looks like you still want to fight.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.750
But if you don't want serious 
injuries, surrender now!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.200
What are you talking about?  
Serious injuries in a duel?

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:37.960
I end my turn!

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.590
So you're not giving up.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.090
It's Mieru's turn!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.430
I draw!

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:48.400
Mieru sets one monster from her 
hand facedown in defense position!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.060
She set another monster?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.110
What will it be this time?

00:04:55.330 --> 00:05:00.040
Prediction Princess Tarotrei's 
additional effect activates!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:07.120
This card switches all my Flip Monsters 
to facedown defense position!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.550
Full Sleep!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.530
It's facedown in defense position again!

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:19.500
Yuya's monsters have less 
than 2600 defense points.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.940
Tarotrei can destroy any of them!

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:25.870
She can destroy whichever one she wants!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.940
I end my turn.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:38.460
I don't need to attack you right now

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:43.460
because your destiny is already determined.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.550
My future isn't determined yet!

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.330
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:55.820
I switch Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon to attack position!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:00.340
That's pointless.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:03.060
I activate Tarotrei's effect!

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.560
Once per opponent's turn,

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:08.880
this card changes my set 
monsters into attack position!

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.910
Full Reverse!

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:21.090
You're able to choose whether your 
Flip Monsters are facedown or faceup.

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:22.260
That's right.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:27.200
Tarotrei's power allows it 
to control a card's destiny!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:30.700
Next, I activate Prediction 
Princess Petalelf's effect!

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:36.560
All your monsters switch to defense position,

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:40.380
and they can't change 
battle position this turn!

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:43.750
I knew it.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:48.480
Yuya's monsters will remain 
in defense position this turn.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.720
He can't attack this turn either!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.480
Next, Prediction Princess Astromorrigan's 
Flip Effect activates!

00:06:56.480 --> 00:07:02.500
When this turn ends, all your monsters 
in defense position are destroyed!

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:10.210
You take 200 points of damage 
for every destroyed monster!

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:15.500
She didn't attack last turn

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.800
so that she could deal more 
damage with this effect!

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:23.660
When Mieru set her very 
first card on the field,

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:26.290
Mieru's victory was already determined!

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:29.700
That can't be true.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.510
It's true.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:38.140
Don't look away.  Face the truth.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.800
Your destiny is heading towards destruction!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.350
My destiny...

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.800
There's still time.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:05.600
To escape destruction, surrender now.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:10.170
Destiny...  Destruction...

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.740
This isn't good.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:18.840
Her fortunetelling has 
completely ensnared Yuya.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:24.450
He must break free and provide entertainment 
that surpasses expectations.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:28.310
It's too dangerous to continue this duel.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:31.160
Yes.  My fortunetelling says the same thing.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.240
He should stop immediately.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.720
No one can oppose their destiny.

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:40.350
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:47.240
Astromorrigan's Flip Effect now 
destroys all your monsters!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:55.410
200 x 5 equals 1000 points of damage!

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.330
Destroyed Pendulum Monsters 
go to the Extra Deck!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.180
Now do you understand?

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:13.330
Mieru is only telling you because 
she's worried about you.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:17.980
If you don't stop fighting, you'll 
pass the point of no return.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.510
It's pointless to say anything.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:25.580
It's Mieru's turn!  I draw!

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:28.000
Tarotrei's effect activates!

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:33.300
All my Flip Monsters switch 
to facedown defense position!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.820
Full Sleep!

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.100
My set card is Performapal Call.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.540
When I take a direct attack, 
this trap negates the attack.

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:49.130
Then I add two Performapals 
from my deck to my hand

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:53.370
whose combined defense points equal 
the attacking monster's attack points.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:10:00.350
Since Petalelf and Astromorrigan are 
currently set, only Tarotrei can attack.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:04.400
I can use Performapal Call 
to survive the direct attack

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.340
and add new monsters to my hand-

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:09.050
I told you to stop fighting!

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:15.650
I'll tell your fortune using an 
Action Card and read your future.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.880
What's this?

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:22.700
I activate the Action Spell Lock Draw!

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:28.670
You can't draw until you send one 
Action Card to the graveyard!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.610
I can't draw!

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:35.380
The card is telling you to 
stop fighting your destiny.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:38.620
Surrender for your own good!

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.700
If I give up, I can't become a pro.

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.090
I don't want that!

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:46.830
You're still going to continue?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.060
In that case, I must end this duel quickly.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:53.570
Mieru sets one card and ends her turn.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:58.020
Mieru set the card Reverse Reuse.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:01.370
The trap Special Summons two 
Flip Monsters in my graveyard

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:05.480
to his field in faceup defense position.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:11.920
If this activates, my Petalelf-Astromorrigan 
combo will end the duel.

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:18.940
And that fortune won't come true.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:35.210
I attack you directly with Frightfur Bear.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:42.800
Now I have 0 life points!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.120
I did it!  Six wins in a row!

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:54.330
Congrats!  You can enter the 
Junior Youth Championship!

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:58.800
With my skills, this outcome was inevitable.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.700
Sora, by the way-

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:01.560
Let's go!

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.270
If we don't hurry, Yuya's duel will be over!

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:10.180
My turn!

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:13.410
Due to Lock Draw's effect, you can't draw!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.010
I know that!

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.250
Even so...

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.480
Stop already!

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:27.260
Even if you continue the duel, 
nothing good will happen to you!

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:28.880
Give up!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:31.180
I said that you're in danger!

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:23.820
The Action Spell Miracle!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:24.960
All right!

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.980
Yuya did it!

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.290
I'm getting shivers!

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:32.760
No way...  He changed his destiny?

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:37.730
He overcame the risk to his 
life and grabbed a miracle?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:42.800
He opened a path to the future 
that was previously closed.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:48.360
I send one Action Card to the 
graveyard to unlock Lock Draw!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:50.810
Good!  Now...

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.680
I bet everything on this card!

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:56.620
I draw!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.620
Polymerization?

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:03.820
Why do I have Yuzu's card?

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.840
I get it!  It happened then!

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.800
I bet my future on this draw.

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:20.570
And I drew a card that I can't use!

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.780
What was that?

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.230
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:50.700
I've already set Scale 1 Stargazer 
Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:55.670
I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:58.640
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.340
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:03.380
Pendulum Summon!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.080
Come out, my monsters!

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:16.680
Look at these noble figures!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:21.100
These once-defeated Pendulum Monsters 
have reappeared from the Extra Deck!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.520
All right!  Here comes the counterattack!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.800
But...

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.770
I activate Tarotrei's effect!

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:30.910
Full Reverse!

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:42.090
Due to Petalelf's Flip Effect, all your 
monsters switch to defense position!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.790
It's the same as last time!

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:50.930
You're lucky that you escaped 
your destiny of destruction.

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:54.270
Mieru now doesn't have to hold back to win.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:56.330
At the end of this turn,

00:15:56.330 --> 00:16:01.600
Astromorrigan's Flip Effect will destroy 
all your monsters in defense position.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:06.040
And you will take 200 points 
of damage for each monster!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:08.710
You have 300 life points, so it's over.

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:10.700
Now do you understand?

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.440
You cannot win this duel!

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:17.890
We'll see about that, young lady.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:20.090
Young lady?

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:23.560
I activate Performapal Springoose's effect!

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:26.040
By banishing this card from the graveyard,

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.860
I can return two cards 
on my field to my hand!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.610
Return to my hand, Stargazer and Timegazer!

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:38.530
Just wait.  I'll bring you out soon.

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:43.110
I tribute Performapal Kaleidoscorp

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:48.130
to Tribute Summon Level 5 Stargazer Magician!

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.100
Awesome!  It's not over yet!

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:57.060
Next...

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:58.260
That's...

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:03.040
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.090
What?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:07.600
Yuya is Fusion Summoning?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:18.220
I fuse Stargazer Magician and 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.960
The one who controls mysterious power,

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:26.460
transform into dazzling light 
and reside in the dragon's eye!

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:29.960
Fusion Summon!

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:34.220
Come out, the sky dragon 
that wields secret arts!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.870
Rune-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:50.650
What's this?

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:54.120
A Fusion Monster with 3000 attack points?

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:59.310
But too bad!  That's not enough 
to eliminate Mieru's life points!

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:01.590
Your destiny won't change!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:06.060
Young lady, when a Spellcaster-Type 
monster on my field

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:10.680
fuses to form Rune-Eyes Pendulum Dragon...

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:16.790
...the number of times it can attack 
changes depending on its Level.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:17.980
What?

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:21.080
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon fused with...

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.450
Level 5 Stargazer Magician!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:28.690
If I fuse a Level 5 or 6 monster, 
it can attack three times!

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.360
It's showtime!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.680
Let's battle, young lady.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:14.070
Attack Astromorrigan, Petalelf and Tarotrei!

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:20.760
This is the climax!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.540
Continuous Shiny Burst!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.160
Hey!

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.110
You did it, Yuya!

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.780
You fused after Pendulum Summoning!

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:07.360
I'll name it Pendulum Fusion!

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:09.640
Pendulum Fusion!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.090
That gives me shivers!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.510
Pendulum Fusion...

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.560
Incredible!  Impressive, Yuya!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:20.530
You were able to Fusion Summon 
even though I didn't teach you!

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.500
Sora and Yuzu, when did you get here?

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.200
Yuya, just now...

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:26.780
Oh, sorry.

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:29.780
I used your card without your permission.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.320
I'm giving this back to you.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.900
Are you sure?

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:39.000
Of course.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:44.290
With that card, you're 
working hard to change.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.160
Now it's my turn.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:48.420
Thanks to you, I was able to get a hint.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:53.530
I'll discover what's beyond 
Pendulum Summon myself!

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:04.300
Mieru's soulmate!

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:05.680
Yuya?

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.900
You truly are my soulmate!

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:11.960
It suddenly struck me!

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:15.150
Mieru's fortunetelling wasn't wrong!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:19.360
What do you mean by "soulmate?"

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:22.830
I don't know either.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.030
Aww, darling.

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:27.100
You're blushing!

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:30.400
Yuya!

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.200
You have it all wrong!

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.820
Who is this girl?

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:38.910
Mieru and her darling are united by destiny!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:45.800
He created his own destiny, so I 
wonder what destiny awaits him.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:49.860
What's this?

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:53.740
Darling!

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:56.540
Wait a sec!  Yuzu!

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:03.060
Darling, when will you meet my mom and dad?

00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:05.820
How many children do you want?

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:09.420
I'll change that destiny!

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:18.740
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:28.220
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:40.230
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.490 --> 00:22:45.470
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:50.910
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:56.170
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:01.770
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:06.190
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:12.160
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:17.570
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:22.870
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:32.210
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:40.460
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:50.620
Target acquired!  I found the 
culprit behind all the attacks!

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:55.200
Understood!  Let's take care of 
him quick before Top Team arrives!

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:59.200
I'm here too!  Let's duel 
using battle royal rules!

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:03.550
Professor Marco is my teacher!  
I'll never forgive you!

00:24:03.550 --> 00:24:06.530
We will get his revenge!

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:11.420
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Wings of Rebellion  Raidraptor

00:24:11.420 --> 00:24:13.770
The fun is only getting started!
